@startuml
title Campaign: the promoter, and the sponsor who buys it on the market
[*] --> draft : promoter assembles (60)
draft --> offered : promoter offers (62)
offered --> withdrawn : promoter withdraws (63)
offered --> agreed : sponsor buys on the market (94)
draft -[dotted]-> offered : sponsor cannot offer (64)
draft -[dotted]-> agreed : sponsor cannot buy what is not on offer (96)
offered -[dotted]-> agreed : sponsor cannot buy a campaign holding a sold package (98)
withdrawn --> [*]
agreed --> [*]
@enduml
